WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:13.985
Danny: Bello, we’re going to go now.

2
00:00:13.986 --> 00:00:16.791
Brad: It’s been nice meeting you.

3
00:00:16.792 --> 00:00:19.675
Tina: Your daddy will be home soon, okay?

4
00:00:19.676 --> 00:00:28.102
You stay here and wait for him.

5
00:00:28.103 --> 00:00:29.634
Bello: Bye-bye.

6
00:00:29.635 --> 00:00:31.816
Tina: Bye, Bello.

7
00:00:31.817 --> 00:00:34.893
Brad: Well, let’s follow the little bug home.

8
00:00:34.894 --> 00:00:43.482
Danny: Okay, bug, show us the way.

9
00:00:43.483 --> 00:00:47.303
Danny: Going home now doesn’t feel very heroic.

10
00:00:47.304 --> 00:00:50.926
Tina: That’s because we’re not acting like heroes.

11
00:00:50.927 --> 00:00:52.862
Brad: Why do you say that?

12
00:00:52.863 --> 00:00:55.671
Tina: We didn’t complete our mission.

13
00:00:55.672 --> 00:00:57.160
Danny: I don’t know.

14
00:00:57.161 --> 00:01:00.980
Maybe we did enough.

15
00:01:00.981 --> 00:01:03.660
Danny: This is not a happy place.

16
00:01:03.661 --> 00:01:06.009
Brad: Geez, look at the sun.

17
00:01:06.010 --> 00:01:08.834
It’s almost black.

18
00:01:08.835 --> 00:01:19.333
Tina: This place would be less gloomy if the sun were shining.

19
00:01:19.334 --> 00:01:22.332
Brad: It’s the same door as last time.

20
00:01:22.333 --> 00:01:24.789
Tina: I don’t like the look of it.

21
00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:26.737
Danny: Hopian said we should go.

22
00:01:26.738 --> 00:01:28.943
We have to trust him.

23
00:01:28.944 --> 00:01:31.040
Tina: You first!

24
00:01:31.041 --> 00:01:35.704
Danny: Fine. I’m not scared.

25
00:01:35.705 --> 00:01:38.700
Tina: Maybe you are a little scared.

26
00:01:38.701 --> 00:01:43.000
Danny: No!

27
00:01:43.001 --> 00:01:46.131
Brad: Danny, what have you done!

28
00:01:46.132 --> 00:01:49.304
Tina: You squashed Hopian’s messenger bug!

29
00:01:49.305 --> 00:01:54.426
Danny: No! That is Hopian’s messenger bug!

30
00:01:54.427 --> 00:01:57.294
Brad: Then who sent the gray bug?

31
00:01:57.295 --> 00:02:01.537
Tina: It was a trap after all!

32
00:02:01.538 --> 00:02:05.513
Tristay: Nooo! Those kids were almost gone for good.

33
00:02:05.514 --> 00:02:09.135
Tristay: Hopian, this is all your fault!

34
00:02:09.136 --> 00:02:11.727
Hopian: I don’t know what you mean.

35
00:02:11.728 --> 00:02:14.859
Tristay: You sent that red bug to warn them.

36
00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:17.658
Hopian: And what if I did?

37
00:02:17.659 --> 00:02:21.833
Tristay: You won’t try anything like that again after I punish you.

38
00:02:21.834 --> 00:02:25.128
Hopian: There’s nothing you can do to hurt me.

39
00:02:25.129 --> 00:02:27.869
Tristay: Oh yes, there is.

40
00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:30.025
Go get Hopian’s son!

41
00:02:30.026 --> 00:02:33.250
Hopian: No!

42
00:02:33.251 --> 00:02:38.163
Brad: I have a feeling that strange door didn’t lead back home.

43
00:02:38.164 --> 00:02:41.722
Danny: Home! We left Bello all alone at home!

44
00:02:41.723 --> 00:02:44.456
Tina: We have to get there quickly.

45
00:02:44.457 --> 00:02:47.254
Danny: Do you think Bello is safe?

46
00:02:47.255 --> 00:02:49.125
Brad: Tristay captured Hopian.

47
00:02:49.126 --> 00:02:52.438
He might try to capture Bello too.

48
00:02:52.439 --> 00:02:57.734
Tina: We have to run faster!

49
00:02:57.735 --> 00:03:02.418
All three: Bello! Bello!

50
00:03:02.419 --> 00:03:03.754
Tina: Come over here!

51
00:03:03.755 --> 00:03:05.892
The back door is open!

52
00:03:05.893 --> 00:03:08.152
Danny: We’re too late!

53
00:03:08.153 --> 00:03:13.913
Bello: Help!
